    accTitle: Scene renderer implementations
    accDescr: Forward+ and Mobile inherit through the RD scene base. GLES3 and dummy implement the shared scene renderer interface independently.
    Scene[RendererSceneRender] -->|implemented by| RDScene[RendererSceneRenderRD]
    RDScene -->|specialized by| Plus[RenderForwardClustered]
    RDScene -->|specialized by| Mobile[RenderForwardMobile]
    Scene -->|implemented by| GLScene[RasterizerSceneGLES3]
    Scene -->|implemented by| DummyScene[RasterizerSceneDummy]
